ls.text.article.1.title=Imperial Edict of the End Crusade
ls.text.article.1.1=Royal Calendar Year 3724 · Frostmoon
ls.text.article.1.2= 
ls.text.article.1.3=The king’s decree shines bright, as Heaven’s mandate burns with light.
ls.text.article.1.4=The End’s vile scourge has trespassed upon our realm time and again.
ls.text.article.1.5=Above the obsidian citadel, the Lord of Endermen stands insolent and proud!
ls.text.article.1.6=Within the purpur palace, the dragon’s roar tears the sky asunder.
ls.text.article.1.7=They have razed our villages and slaughtered our people.
ls.text.article.1.8=Such heinous crimes stir the wrath of gods and mortals alike!
ls.text.article.1.9= 
ls.text.article.1.10=We hereby command the “Seven Stars of Heroes”
ls.text.article.1.11=to wield the divine blade, lead the royal army,
ls.text.article.1.12=and march against the rebellious. Grant you three sacred treasures:
ls.text.article.1.13=First, the “Legendary Sword”, capable of cutting down all things.
ls.text.article.1.14=Second, the “Blazing Wand”, capable of burning all cities.
ls.text.article.1.15=Third, the “Legendary Shield”, unbreakable and enduring.
ls.text.article.1.16=Until the End is conquered, we shall not return to the capital!
